#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1219 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "FRESH, DISCRIMINATING. No class= (the twins declare none and Scope carries no Classes axis). Zero data rows. Predicted SILENT, same mechanism as PMDA-SD1215-valid_empty_dataset-TS. Authored here as well because SD1219 is the twin group with NO covered CORE sibling (CORE-000731 is uncovered), so the LENGTH member has the thinnest inherited coverage of the three TS pairs. Escalate on a fire."
#expectViolationCount 0
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
